    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;7.01</strong> Summary of causes and mechanisms of production of gynaecomastia</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Maria Pia Foschini",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Etiology</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Age group</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Mechanism of production of gynaecomastia</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Physiological</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Children and adolescents</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Estrogens and androgens hormonal imbalance <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28613047}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Physiological senile</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Elderly adults</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Relative increase in estrogen levels <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{14759718}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Familial increased aromatization of androgens</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Children</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Increased aromatization of androgens <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{15811932}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>X-linked disorders</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Full or partial androgen insensitivity syndromes <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{27087292; 26609365}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Klinefelter syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>AR</em> gene with higher number of CAG repeats leading to a reduction in its activity <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{27611179}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Carney complex</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Children</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Development of Sertoli cell tumours <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{26366315}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Peutz&ndash;Jeghers syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Children</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Loss of heterozygosity of <em>STK11</em> leading to increased aromatase expression in testicular Sertoli cells and in breast tissue <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28560011}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Exogenous estrogens</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Adults</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Estrogens and androgens hormonal imbalance <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{30003107}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Androgen deprivation therapy for prostate cancer</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Adults</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Unopposed estrogen activity <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{30248169}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Testicular or adrenal tumours</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Mainly adults</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Increased estrogen production <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29193251}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Aromatase excess syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Alterations in the aromatase gene <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{24716396}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Drugs</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Mainly adults</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">Several mechanisms, depending on the type of drug; reviewed by Nuttall et al. {25827472} and Costanzo et al. {30003107}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Obesity</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Dependent on cause of obesity <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28217517}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Alcohol-induced cirrhosis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Adults</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Several mechanisms proposed, such as reduced activity of cytochrome&nbsp;P450 and abnormal testosterone-to-estrogen ratio <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{21484105}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Spinobulbar muscular atrophy</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Similar to in Klinefelter syndrome&nbsp;&ndash; an increased number of CAG repeats in the <em>AR</em> gene <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29464380}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Unknown</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Mainly adults</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Reviewed&nbsp;<span class=\"Ref-PMID\">Reviewed by Costanzo et al. {30003107}</span><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
